# Whitelist — everything is ignored unless explicitly allowed below.
# Only the launcher scripts and bind-mount patch files ship in this repo.
# Docs, plans, sweep tooling, and the 256k variant are intentionally absent
# for now (see DwarfStar4/ for the previous-generation launcher).
*

!.gitignore
!start.sh
!stop.sh
!/README.md
!download.sh
!image-patch/
!image-patch/**
__pycache__/
*.pyc
!DwarfStar4/
!DwarfStar4/*.sh
!DwarfStar4/bench.jpg
